      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:5:3:76:5",
      "text": [
        " إِذَا جَرَّدَ الرَّجُلُ الْجَارِيَةَ وَ وَضَعَ يَدَهُ عَلَيْهَا فَلَا تَحِلُّ لِابْنِهِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Ismail, from Al Fazl Bin Shazaan, form Ibn Abu Umeyr, from Rabie Bin Abdullah, from Muhammad Bin Muslim, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘When the man bares the slave girl and places his hand upon her, so she would not be Permitted unto his father’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "5. Muhammad ibn ‘Isma’il has narrated from al-Fadl ibn Shadhan from ibn abu ‘Umayr from Rib’iy ibn ‘Abd Allah from Muhammad ibn Muslim who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘If a man makes a slave-girl bare and places his hand on her she becomes unlawful for his son.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
